                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطَلَهُ بِدَيْنِهِ</span></b> 
                        , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطْلٌ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا طَلَهُ</span></b> , inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطَالٌ</span>, <i>He delayed,</i> or <i>deferred, with him,</i> or <i>put
